[I] JPEG optimization utility

[T] jpegoptim is a utility to optimize and compress JPEG files. It provides
[T] lossless optimization based on optimizing the Huffman tables, and lossy
[T] optimization by setting a maximum quality factor or target size, and can
[T] strip metadata.

[U] https://github.com/tjko/jpegoptim

[A] Jpegoptim Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

